          "id": "1468628861021659136",
          "type": "quoted"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Check out research from @scale_AI’s AI team at NeurIPS this year 🎉\n\nVery proud of our team for not only delivering meaningful AI products which improve our customers’ AI products (fun part of being an infrastructure company), but also publishing great research into NeurIPS 🥳 https://t.co/IIsdP3gnz0",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1468779146247507969"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2021-12-06T04:40:11.000Z",
