        "bookmark_count": 214,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 373,
        "quote_count": 8,
        "reply_count": 14,
        "retweet_count": 52
      },
      "text": "I'm publishing a @scale_AI memo which came out of a meta-learning from my most optimistic mentor, Jeff Wilke, former CEO of Amazon Consumer.\n\nCheck it out below 👇 \n\nhttps://t.co/kOEP08OV9x",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1462491663985565699"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2021-11-18T22:46:45.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1461465931851309062"
      ],
      "id": "1461465931851309062",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 14,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 54,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 6
      },
      "text": "The right motto for a technology company is:\n\n\"Move fast, shrink things\"\n\n- Shrink batch sizes (big visions happen in small steps!)\n- Shrink team sizes (2-pizza teams are brilliant)\n- Shrink products (easier to sell a calf than a herd)\n\nMore shrinking -&gt; less breaking",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1461465931851309062"
    },
    {
