          "quote_count": 1,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 4
        },
        "text": "We are proud to have 3 papers accepted to @NeurIPSConf 2021! Read our latest blog for an overview of each and to download our latest open-source dataset, DEBAGREEMENT: Reddit 50K developed in partnership with @UniofOxford. https://t.co/Gyxj5uNfoS"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1979921",
        "created_at": "2021-12-06T03:44:38.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1467701490458320897"
        ],
        "entities": {
          "urls": [
            {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 17,
